@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Returns & Exchange Policy";
}

<div class="container legal-page">
    <h1>Return & Exchange Policy</h1>
    <div class="legal-content">
        <h3>Return Policy</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Timeframe:</strong> Returns are accepted within 15 days of delivery for orders placed outside sale periods.</li>
            <li><strong>Non-Returnable Products:</strong> Due to hygiene standards, we don’t accept returns on certain items, including caps, hats, masks, boxers, shorts, bodysuits, crop tops, tank tops, baby tees, and stationery items like stickers.</li>
            <li><strong>Condition:</strong> Items must be in their original, unwashed condition with all tags attached.</li>
            <li><strong>Return Refusals:</strong> We reserve the right to decline returns if items appear used, washed, damaged, or spoiled (unless they arrived damaged).</li>
            <li><strong>Defective Products:</strong> If you’ve received a defective item, please email unboxing videos and Photos to valousworld@gmail.com, and our Customer Experience Team will assist.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Return Charges and Refunds</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Return Fee:</strong> A reverse shipment fee of Rs 100 will be deducted at the time of refund per order, regardless of the number of items within that order. Shipping Charges are Non-Refundable both COD & Prepaid.</li>
            <li><strong>Refund Method:</strong> Refund is to be issued as credits to your Valous World Gift Card only, via email.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Exchange Policy</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Timeframe:</strong> Exchanges are accepted within 15 days of delivery for orders placed outside sale periods.</li>
            <li><strong>Exchange Fee:</strong> A reverse shipment charge of ₹100 fee on COD orders.</li>
            <li><strong>Price Difference in Exchanges:</strong> If the new item is priced higher than the original, you’ll need to pay the difference upfront via a prepaid method. If the new item is priced lower, the remaining balance will be issued to you as a Gift Card for future purchases.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Return & Exchange Process</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>The Return or Exchange can be initiated via the Website or the App.</li>
            <li>The process will be initiated only when the Customer Experience Team accepts your requests, typically within 48 hours post the request raised from the customers end.</li>
            <li>Reverse pickups will be arranged only after confirmation from Customer Experience Team.</li>
            <li><strong>Packaging:</strong> Please ensure items are packaged as they were delivered to you.</li>
            <li>The refund method stays the same as Valous World Gift Card for both COD & Prepaid Orders.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Order Cancellation</h3>
        <p>PLEASE NOTE, Cancellations will only be possible if and till the order has not been dispatched from our warehouse.</p>

        <h3>3-Month Guarantee (Up to 50 Washes)</h3>
        <p>Valous World offers a 3-month guarantee on its products mentioned below, covering up to 50 washes. This guarantee applies to any defects or damages within this timeframe, entitling you to a replacement product. *(3 months from the day of delivery)*</p>
        <p><strong>Covered Issues:</strong> Loose seams or stitching, Discoloration or fading of fabric, Uneven dye application, Excessive pilling or fuzzing, Misplaced or missing embellishments, Severe wrinkling or creasing, Tears or frays along the edges.</p>
        <p><strong>Not Covered:</strong> Damage from improper washing or care, Wear and tear from regular use, Any alterations after purchase, Damage from accidents, misuse, or neglect.</p>

        <h3>GiftCard – Terms and Conditions</h3>
        <ul>
            <li>The Valous World “GiftCard” amount can solely be used on valousworld.com against purchases made on the website.</li>
            <li>The Valous World “GiftCard” amount is non-refundable, It cannot be transferred back to source (into bank account).</li>
            <li>The Valous World “GiftCard” amount is non-transferable. It cannot be transferred to other user account.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .legal-page { padding: 50px 20px 80px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .legal-page h1 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--black); padding-bottom: 16px; }
    .legal-content { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--gray-800); }
    .legal-content h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 24px 0 10px; }
    .legal-content p { margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .legal-content ul { margin: 10px 0 14px 20px; padding-left: 10px; }
    .legal-content li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
    @@media (max-width: 600px) {
        .legal-page { padding: 30px 16px 60px; }
        .legal-page h1 { font-size: 22px; }
        .legal-content h3 { font-size: 14px; }
        .legal-content { font-size: 13px; }
    }
</style>